      <div class="admin-bootstrap-note"><strong>Administrator:</strong> Mahmoud Hamouda · mahmod.hamoda@gmail.com. If this Authentication account does not exist yet, register that email once using the administrator password. The password is never stored in this HTML file.</div>
      <p class="auth-note">This app requires Firebase Authentication and Cloud Firestore to be enabled in project <strong>mhmnursing-4375d</strong>.</p>
    </main>
  </div>
</section>

<div id="appShell" class="app-screen">
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="brand"><span class="mark">NAB</span><h1 id="topTitle">Nursing Assignment Board</h1></div>
    <div class="user-bar"><span id="topUser"></span><span id="topRole" class="role-badge"></span><div class="nav-actions"><button class="nav-btn" data-go="home">Home</button><button class="nav-btn" data-go="view">View</button><button id="navEdit" class="nav-btn" data-go="edit">Edit</button><button id="navAdmin" class="nav-btn" data-go="admin">Users</button><button id="logoutBtn" class="nav-btn">Sign out</button></div></div>
  </div>

  <main id="homeScreen" class="inner-screen">
    <div class="home-wrap">
      <div class="home-header"><div class="eyebrow">Four nurse stations · Firestore · real-time updates</div><h1>One overview, four station boards</h1><p>Assignments are stored online by date. Staff can view; supervisors can create and update today or future dates; previous dates are permanently read-only.</p><div class="home-role-summary"><span>Staff: view only</span><span>Supervisor: edit today/future</span><span>Administrator: manage roles</span></div></div>
